{"seq":2,"slug":"biogeography","title":"大学地理学 — 生物地理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/geography/environmental-geography/biogeography","wordCount":1342,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学地理学-生物地理学\">大学地理学 — 生物地理学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>生物地理学研究地球上生物的空间分布格局及其形成机制，探讨物种多样性为何随纬度、海拔、面积等因素呈现规律性变化。该学科将生态学、进化生物学与地理学交叉融合，为理解全球生物多样性提供时空框架。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心概念体系\">核心概念体系</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>经典案例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生物区系 (Biota)</td>\n<td>某一地理区域所有动植物类群的总和</td>\n<td>古北界、新热带界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生物地理区 (Biogeographic Realm)</td>\n<td>基于演化历史划分的大尺度区域</td>\n<td>Wallace 六大动物地理区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特有种 (Endemic Species)</td>\n<td>仅分布于特定区域的物种</td>\n<td>马达加斯加狐猴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避难所 (Refugium)</td>\n<td>冰期中物种存续的局部区域</td>\n<td>云南-贵州避难所</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离分化 (Vicariance)</td>\n<td>地理障碍导致种群隔离并独立演化</td>\n<td>冈瓦纳大陆分裂后南半球植物分化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩散 (Dispersal)</td>\n<td>物种跨越障碍到达新区域的过程</td>\n<td>太平洋岛屿鸟类的跳板式扩散</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"岛屿生物地理学理论\">岛屿生物地理学理论</h3><p>MacArthur 与 Wilson (1967) 提出的岛屿生物地理学平衡理论是该学科的里程碑。核心模型描述：岛屿上物种数由物种迁入率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 与灭绝率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 的动态平衡决定。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{S} = f(I, E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>迁入率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 随物种数增加而下降，灭绝率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 随物种数增加而上升。两条曲线交点即为平衡物种数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>种-面积关系</strong> 是该理论的基础经验规律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>z</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = cA^z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为物种数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为面积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 为截距常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 为斜率（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.35</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.2 \\le z \\le 0.35</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.35</span></span></span></span></span>）。在双对数坐标中呈线性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log S = \\log c + z \\log A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>距离效应</strong>：离大陆越远的岛屿，迁入率越低，平衡物种数越少。这一预测已在加拉帕戈斯群岛、夏威夷群岛等地得到验证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"wallace-线与生物地理分界\">Wallace 线与生物地理分界</h3><p>Alfred Russel Wallace 在1859年注意到巴厘岛与龙目岛之间存在显著的动物区系差异。后来命名的 <strong>Wallace 线</strong> 沿加里曼丹岛与苏拉威西岛之间延伸，标志着东洋界和澳洲界的过渡边界。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分界线</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>生物学意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Wallace 线</td>\n<td>巴厘-龙目、加里曼丹-苏拉威西</td>\n<td>有袋类/有胎盘类的分布边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weber 线</td>\n<td>马鲁古群岛东侧</td>\n<td>澳洲成分占主导的起点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lydekker 线</td>\n<td>新几内亚-澳大利亚大陆架边缘</td>\n<td>澳洲界的东界</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些分界线的形成与巽他陆架和萨胡尔陆架在更新世海平面变化中的连接断开直接相关。</p>\n<h3 id=\"纬度多样性梯度\">纬度多样性梯度</h3><p>从赤道向两极，物种多样性呈下降趋势。解释该格局的主要假说：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>能量假说</strong>：热带地区太阳辐射能量更高，支持更多个体和物种</li>\n<li><strong>面积假说</strong>：热带生物群区面积在地质时期始终最大</li>\n<li><strong>进化速率假说</strong>：热带地区突变率和物种形成速率更高</li>\n<li><strong>生态位保守假说</strong>：多数分类群起源于热带，尚未演化出耐寒适应</li>\n</ul>\n<p>目前认为多种机制协同作用，尚无单一假说能完全解释该梯度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保护生物地理学\">保护生物地理学</h3><p>生物地理学原理直接应用于自然保护区设计。SLOSS 争论（Single Large Or Several Small）源自岛屿理论：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单一大面积保护区</strong>：减少边缘效应，维持内部栖息地完整性</li>\n<li><strong>多个小面积保护区</strong>：覆盖更多栖息地类型，分散灭绝风险</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实际保护策略通常结合两者：以核心保护区为锚点，通过生态廊道连接多个保护区形成网络。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>某群岛有大小不同的5个岛屿，面积分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1 = 10, A_2 = 50, A_3 = 100, A_4 = 500, A_5 = 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> km²。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = 5, z = 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>，计算各岛屿的预测物种数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>查找一个因地理隔离产生特有种的案例，分析其隔离分化机制与扩散过程。</li>\n<li>Wallace 线东西两侧的哺乳动物组成有何根本差异？这种差异如何用板块构造历史解释？</li>\n<li>讨论气候变化对纬度多样性梯度可能产生的影响，预测未来生物分布格局变化。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>MacArthur, R. H. &amp; Wilson, E. O. (1967). <em>The Theory of Island Biogeography</em></li>\n<li>Lomolino, M. V. et al. (2016). <em>Biogeography: Biological Diversity across Space and Time</em> (5th ed.)</li>\n<li>Wallace 线与东南亚生物地理研究是理解隔离分化与扩散的经典教材</li>\n<li>GBIF (全球生物多样性信息设施) 提供全球物种分布开放数据</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生物地理学通过种-面积关系、岛屿平衡理论和生物地理分区等核心框架，解释全球生物多样性的空间格局。Wallace 线等经典分界线展示了地质历史对生物分布的深远影响，而纬度多样性梯度仍是当代生态学的核心谜题。这些理论不仅是基础科学，更直接指导着自然保护区规划和生物多样性保护实践。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学地理学 — 生物地理学","id":"大学地理学-生物地理学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"核心概念体系","id":"核心概念体系"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"岛屿生物地理学理论","id":"岛屿生物地理学理论"},{"level":3,"text":"Wallace 线与生物地理分界","id":"wallace-线与生物地理分界"},{"level":3,"text":"纬度多样性梯度","id":"纬度多样性梯度"},{"level":3,"text":"保护生物地理学","id":"保护生物地理学"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学地理学 — 土壤学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/geography/environmental-geography/soil-science"},"next":{"title":"大学地理学 — 自然灾害","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/geography/environmental-geography/natural-hazards"}}